  "description": "◇ ‘What is “Muv-Luv Unlimited: The Day After”?’\nA spin-off title of the Muv-Luv series, following on from ‘Muv-Luv’ and ‘Muv-Luv Alternative’.\nThe fourth title in a spin-off series originating from “Muv-Luv Unlimited”, which diverges into a different future from the anime-adapted “Muv-Luv Alternative.”\nAfter protagonist Shirogane Takeru sees the heroine’s escape from Earth in “Muv-Luv Unlimited”, the story depicts those left behind on Earth who nonetheless continue to fight against their doom.\n\n◇ Story\nThe war between Japan, the United States, Canada, and France — born from the food crisis — quietened for a time, but the underlying issue remained.\nA ravaged Earth, the threat of the BETA, the struggle for dominance between nations, and the ordinary people caught up in it all.\nWhat path will Hibiki, now hailed as the Empire’s hero, take?",
